If pack sizes are supported, store the pack conversion explicitly and convert all movements to the inventory's base unit. Otherwise, let the user select the actual countable unit and enter the quantity directly.

The Low Stock Level must control the low-stock indicator. Do not hardcode a universal threshold.

#### Beverage table

