In Actions, retain **Edit** and **Delete** only. Remove the extra filter/adjustment icon beside them.

The Edit action should allow authorised staff to update the selling price and adjust the quantity through an appropriate stock adjustment workflow. Preserve stock history if the project already tracks it. Do not silently overwrite stock counts in a way that destroys existing movement records.

